about=banner('Building Trust Through Quality Construction.','Strategic Construction Group approaches construction with care, collaboration and a commitment to quality across Cape Town.','during.jpg','ABOUT US')+f'''<section class="section wrap split"><div><p class="kicker gold">WHO WE ARE</p><h2>Building with purpose. Working with you.</h2><p class="lead">We are a Cape Town construction group focused on delivering thoughtful solutions for the places people live, work and build.</p><p>Our work spans residential, commercial, industrial and infrastructure requirements. We seek to understand each client’s goals, define the project scope and coordinate the work with attention to quality and client satisfaction.</p></div><div class="split-image">{img('civil.jpg','Illustrative construction site and earthworks')}</div></section><section class="section pale"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><p class="kicker gold">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Build with care.</h2><p>To deliver quality construction services through professional execution, responsible project management and solutions focused on our clients.</p></div><div><p class="kicker gold">OUR VISION</p><h2>A trusted partner.</h2><p>To become a trusted construction partner in Cape Town and the wider Western Cape, known for a considered approach to every project.</p></div></div></section><section class="section wrap">{intro('WHAT GUIDES US','Our values.','The principles we bring to our work and our relationships.')}<div class="value-grid light-values">{''.join(f'<div><span>{i:02d}</span><h3>{v}</h3></div>' for i,v in enumerate(['Quality','Integrity','Safety','Accountability','Professionalism','Client Satisfaction'],1))}</div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="narrow"><p class="kicker gold">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>Every project begins with understanding.</h2><p>We listen to client requirements, assess the scope and plan resources before work begins. During construction we coordinate activities, monitor progress and inspect quality, working toward a considered handover of the completed project.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-process/">Explore our process →</a></div></section>{cta('Have a Project in Mind?','Tell us what you are planning and start a conversation.','Talk to Our Team')}'''
